<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .page {
    width: 794px;
    height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
    page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child {
    page-break-after: auto;
  }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .header-logo-container {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .logo {
    height: 50px; /* Placeholder for logo size */
    margin-right: 20px;
  }
  .title-section {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .contact-info {
    margin-top: 30px;
    font-size: 0.9em;
  }
  .section-heading {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 25px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .content-block {
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .footer {
    margin-top: 80px;
    padding-top: 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid #ccc;
    font-size: 0.8em;
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-logo-container">
    <div style="font-size: 2em; font-weight: bold;">CSUN</div>
    <div class="logo" style="/* Placeholder for University Union Logo */"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="title-section">
    <p style="font-size: 0.9em;">{{ current_date }}</p>
  </div>

  <div class="contact-info">
    <p>Contact: <span data-field="contact.name">{{ contact.name }}</span>, Public Relations Assistant</p>
    <p>Email: <span data-field="contact.email">{{ contact.email }}</span></p>
    <p>Michael Niles, Marketing Manager</p>
    <p>University Student Union</p>
    <p>California State University, Northridge</p>
    <p>michael.niles@csun.edu</p>
    <p>({{ contact.phone }})</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section-heading">Media Alert</div>

  <div class="content-block">
    <p><strong>WHAT:</strong></p>
    <p>The Student Recreation Center of the University Student Union (USU) invites the CSUN Community to Fall Back Into Fitness and discover an even better version of yourself. From Monday, Sept. 13 to Sunday, Oct. 10, come engage in a variety of health and fitness activities as you step up and get active in the new semester. In addition, you'll earn points and win some great SRC swag and gift cards ranging from $10 to $75. Plus, the participant with the most points will receive a special grand prize to be announced at the start of the challenge. It all starts by creating a personal fitness routine that's enjoyable for you!</p>
  </div>

  <div class="content-block">
    <p><strong>WHO:</strong></p>
    <p>Amanda Christianson, Assistant Director, Fitness and Wellness.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="content-block">
    <p><strong>WHEN:</strong></p>
    <p>Monday, Sept. 13 - Sunday, Oct. 10</p>
  </div>

  <div class="content-block">
    <p><strong>WHERE:</strong></p>
    <p>ChallengeRunner. Participants track their progress through the ChallengeRunner app for iOS or Android or the ChallengeRunner website and earn points.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="content-block">
    <p><strong>WHY:</strong></p>
    <p>This four-week program promotes the importance of incorporating a healthier routine in your daily life.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="content-block">
    <p><strong>BACKGROUND:</strong></p>
    <p>You're only four weeks away from a fitter and healthier you. Be sure to register on ChallengeRunner and join the "Fall Back Into Fitness 2021" program. For more information, please visit csun.edu/src or contact srcfitprograms@csun.edu.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">***</div>

  <div class="content-block" style="font-size: 0.9em;">
    <p>The University Student Union (USU) is committed to inclusion, diversity and personal growth for all students while providing services such as study areas, a computer lab, TV lounge, prayer room, lactation room and wireless printing kiosks in addition to a wide range of recreational and fitness activities. The USU Student Recreation Center, Oasis Wellness Center, Pride Center, Veterans Resource Center, DREAM Center, USU Board of Directors, Computer Labs, Games Room, USU Programs and more. For additional information, please visit www.csun.edu/usu.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    <p>UNIVERSITY STUDENT UNION</p>
    <p>18111 Nordhoff Street • Northridge • California 91330-8272 • www.csun.edu/usu</p>
  </div>
</div>